WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.500
Hi, I'm Sheri.

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.300
I suffered badly from worn cartilage in my knee.

3
00:00:04.900 --> 00:00:07.200
I couldn't work out, I couldn't manage stairs.

4
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:13.800
About two years ago I had ten electromagnetic pulse treatments,

5
00:00:13.900 --> 00:00:19.600
and since then I feel like new. I haven't needed the treatment again. I feel great, I keep working out and walking,

6
00:00:19.700 --> 00:00:21.800
and I feel really excellent.
